            "review_title": "Review at Sun's Banh Mi",
            "review_text": "Traveller-Lea\n36 contributions\n0\nBest Bahn Mi in Danang!\nFeb 2020\nMy partners is obsessed with Sun’s Bahn Mi! He goes everyday and has tried many in Danang, and he said hands down Sun’s is the best! Also her traditional Vietnamese iced coffee (ca phe sua da) is absolutely delicious and again the best we have had! \nVisit Sun she’s offers friendly service and her Bahn Mi restaurant station and tables are very clean!\nRead more\nWritten February 15, 2020",
