            "review_title": "Review at Sun's Banh Mi",
            "review_text": "Elyce\n4 contributions\n0\nLovely service, great price and delicious food!\nDec 2019 • Family\nThis was a lovely, quiet spot for us to sit and enjoy a meal on the streets of Da Nang. The service was great and the lady was really nice and friendly. She spoke a considerable amount of English too which was very helpful. The range of Banh Mi’s was great - first spot we found that offered a tofu option which I was very excited about! We would definitely recommend checking this place out when in Da Nang!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 30, 2019\nHung Dinh\nDear Guest,\n\nWe would like to thank you for your very kind comment !!\n\nWe hope to welcome you soon back,\n\nWith my best regards,\n\nHung.\nRead more\nWritten January 7, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
